      "particle_messengers": "Particle messengers",
      "paul_steinhardt_one_of_the_original_ar": "Paul Steinhardt (one of the original architects of inflation!) is now one of its loudest critics. His argument: inflation has become unfalsifiable. With enough free parameters and enough possible models, ANY observation can be accommodated. A theory that predicts every possible outcome predicts nothing. Steinhardt has proposed a cyclic / \"bouncing\" alternative in which the universe never had a Big Bang but instead bounces between contraction + expansion phases. Roger Penrose has proposed Conformal Cyclic Cosmology, a different bouncing model. These are minority positions, but they are not crank physics. The mainstream view treats inflation as the leading hypothesis; the alternatives remain on the table.",
