      "3_atmospheres": "3 atmospheres",
      "3_charges_per_dive_8_seconds_between_r": " 3 charges per dive, 8 seconds between releases. Drop a black cloud that breaks every predator's visual lock for ~3 seconds. Real octopus biology: ink is a chemical resource carried in the ink sac (~3-5 doses), with refractory time between releases — not an infinite-use spell.",
      "3d_engine_webgl_failed_to_load_or_init": "⚠ 3D engine / WebGL failed to load or initialize. WebGL might be disabled or unsupported.",
      "3d_hunt_canvas_fallback": "Interactive 3D octopus hunt. Use WASD to crawl, A and D to rotate, Space to jet, I for ink defense, and G to grab shelters.",
      "3d_octopus_hunt_simulator_wasd_to_craw": "3D octopus hunt simulator. WASD to crawl, A and D rotate. Space jets. Click hunts. I uses ink defense. G grabs shelters.",
      "40_camo_15_slower_60s_shelter": " — +40% camo, 15% slower, 60s shelter. ",
      "45_camo_aura_within_1_5u_when_stationa": " — +45% camo aura within 1.5u when stationary, can't carry. ",
      "4_million_tons_of_cephalopods_are_caug": "~4 million tons of cephalopods are caught globally each year. Squid dominate the catch (~3M tons), followed by octopus (~400k tons) and cuttlefish (~300k tons). The fishery has tripled in the last 60 years.",
      "4_million_tons_year": "~4 million tons/year",
