      "capture_mark_paint_tag_release_observe": "Capture, mark (paint, tag), release; observe later for re-encounters. Allows population size estimation.",
      "carbonate_caves_in_coastal_limestone_r": "Carbonate caves in coastal limestone reefs; lava-tube caves in volcanic islands; submerged stalactite caves. Permanent darkness inside; reduced water flow; specialized fauna.",
      "cardiovascular_physiology_of_cephalopo": "Cardiovascular physiology of cephalopods",
      "careers": "Careers",
      "caribbean_reef_dwelling_diurnal_octopu": "Caribbean reef-dwelling diurnal octopus. Distinctive blue-green iridescence + dramatic chromatophore displays during mating. Used in cognition research at multiple Caribbean stations.",
      "caribbean_reef_octopus": "Caribbean Reef Octopus",
      "caribbean_reef_octopus_females_lay_lar": "Caribbean reef octopus females lay LARGE eggs (a few hundred, each ~3 mm) — and hatchlings emerge as miniature adults, skipping the planktonic paralarval stage.",
      "caribbean_tropical_atlantic": "Caribbean + Tropical Atlantic",
      "carnivorous_protein_demanding_requires": "*Carnivorous + protein-demanding* — requires ~3kg of wild-caught fish per 1kg of octopus produced (net food deficit)",
      "carry_portable_shelter_coconut_halves_": "Carry portable shelter (coconut halves, plastic bottles) for use far from natural dens",
