      "jointed_exoskeleton_segmented_body_ins": "Jointed exoskeleton. Segmented body. Insects, crustaceans, spiders.",
      "keep_drought_on_and_run_5_more_years_t": "Keep drought ON and run 5 more years. The population keeps shifting toward larger beaks until it hits the upper end of available variation — selection can't create new traits, only sort existing ones.",
