      "20_actions_to_reduce_earthquake_tsunam": "20 actions to reduce earthquake + tsunami risk. From individual prep (go-bag, family plan) to building retrofit + community awareness. Mostly free or low-cost.",
      "20_climate_tectonic_interactions_throu": "20 climate-tectonic interactions through Earth history. Plate motion controls long-term climate by reshaping ocean currents, mountain weathering, and atmospheric CO2.",
      "20_confirmed_meteor_impact_sites_airbu": "20 confirmed meteor impact sites + airbursts, from the 66 Ma Chicxulub asteroid that ended the dinosaurs to the 2013 Chelyabinsk airburst over Russia.",
      "20_eras_epochs_from_hadean_4_5_ga_to_m": "20 eras + epochs from Hadean (4.5 Ga) to modern Anthropocene. Each tells a story of changing climate, plate configuration, and life.",
      "20_examples_of_indigenous_knowledge_do": "20 examples of Indigenous knowledge documenting geological events + processes. Many traditions long pre-date scientific confirmation and now inform modern hazard understanding.",
      "20_expeditions_projects_that_shaped_mo": "20 expeditions + projects that shaped modern Earth science: from Mary Anning fossil hunting to JOIDES Resolution drilling, from Marie Tharp's ocean floor maps to ICDP continental drilling.",
