      "fore_street_falmouth_now_portland_bloc": "Fore Street, Falmouth (now Portland). Block walkable today from King Middle.",
      "form_a_partnership_instead_of_merging_": "Form a partnership instead of merging — shared contracts, separate ownership.",
      "foundational_scholarly_account_of_how_": "Foundational scholarly account of how printed accuracy and authority were socially constructed.",
