      "cut_strips_from_the_weld_bend_them_aro": "Cut strips from the weld + bend them around a mandrel. The face + root of the weld are stretched. If they crack open or show fissures larger than allowed, you fail.",
      "cutaway_showing_internal_features_sect": "Cutaway showing internal features. Section line on parent view, \"A-A\" or \"B-B\" labels identify which cutting plane.",
